1
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,240
I'm sorry.

2
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:18,840
Over the years,

3
00:00:19,280 --> 00:00:21,000
I haven't been able to give you a proper birthday celebration.

4
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:23,040
It's okay.

5
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,400
I've already gotten used to it.

6
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:27,880
Miaomiao,

7
00:00:32,360 --> 00:00:34,760
there are some things Mom just can't help.

8
00:00:35,360 --> 00:00:36,320
Your little sister is still young,

9
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:37,960
and I need to take care of her as well.

10
00:00:38,519 --> 00:00:39,120
Mom,

11
00:00:39,840 --> 00:00:41,120
I'm not a kid anymore.

12
00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:43,440
I understand a lot of things.

13
00:00:50,680 --> 00:00:52,520
Today's birthday party was really nice.

14
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:53,800
I'm very satisfied.

15
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:56,920
Young man,

16
00:00:58,440 --> 00:01:00,360
I'm entrusting my precious daughter to you.

17
00:01:00,600 --> 00:01:01,400
Take good care of her.

18
00:01:02,720 --> 00:01:04,480
Earlier, you mentioned some kind of link,

19
00:01:04,520 --> 00:01:05,440
what did you mean by that?

20
00:01:06,800 --> 00:01:08,160
Why are you so nosy?

21
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,040
The young couple is just dating,

22
00:01:10,120 --> 00:01:11,279
why are you meddling?

23
00:01:11,760 --> 00:01:12,840
You're even nosier!

24
00:01:13,080 --> 00:01:15,320
What's wrong with me chatting with my future son-in-law?

25
00:01:15,800 --> 00:01:16,560
Did I offend you?

26
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:17,680
You're so annoying.

27
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,640
Knock knock.

28
00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:19,640
Come home with me tonight.

29
00:01:20,600 --> 00:01:21,320
Why?

30
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,400
Why are you even asking?

31
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,160
Stop talking nonsense.

32
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:23,720
Let's go home.

33
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,760
Alright, I'll head home first.

34
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:34,600
Happy birthday, sweetheart.

35
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:44,320
I'm sorry.

36
00:01:44,960 --> 00:01:46,000
I invited them without asking for your permission.

37
00:01:46,440 --> 00:01:47,560
It's alright.

38
00:01:49,280 --> 00:01:49,840
The stars are so bright tonight.

39
00:02:01,280 --> 00:02:02,840
Do they also know it's my birthday today?

40
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:06,280
Stars don't have thoughts.

41
00:02:08,120 --> 00:02:09,560
Their brightness depends on the sunlight they reflect.

42
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:12,720
Such a buzzkill.

43
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,360
But isn't that common sense?

44
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,480
Today, I'm the birthday girl.

45
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:18,800
I get to make the rules.

46
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,080
Everything I say goes.

47
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:23,320
Alright.

48
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:24,440
You call the shots.

49
00:02:26,240 --> 00:02:27,000
Hao Ruichi.

50
00:02:27,880 --> 00:02:28,840
Thank you.

51
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:31,560
Actually, I'm really happy today.

52
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:34,280
I thought you hated your parents.

53
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:38,840
Human emotions are quite complex.

54
00:02:41,840 --> 00:02:42,280
Forget it.

55
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:44,120
Even if I explained, you wouldn't understand.

56
00:02:46,280 --> 00:02:47,640
Then I'll try to understand.

57
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,360
After all, we've already established a connection.

58
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:52,120
We have a long future ahead of us.

59
00:02:52,320 --> 00:02:52,680
No, that's not it.

60
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:54,760
That… that was just a misunderstanding.

61
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:56,440
You don't have to take it seriously.

62
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:57,960
How could I not take it seriously?

63
00:02:58,560 --> 00:02:59,640
Once a connection is made,

64
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:01,840
it remains until the end of our lives.

65
00:03:01,880 --> 00:03:03,280
That's the vow of the Lan Kexing people.

66
00:03:03,640 --> 00:03:04,640
If you're unwilling now,

67
00:03:05,040 --> 00:03:06,640
I'll work hard to become someone you'd want.

68
00:03:07,480 --> 00:03:08,120
But you…

69
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:08,880
But what?

70
00:03:08,920 --> 00:03:10,240
But you haven't even told me yet,

71
00:03:10,320 --> 00:03:12,080
how you truly feel about me.

72
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:14,560
Forget it.

73
00:03:14,920 --> 00:03:15,960
I haven't figured it out either.

74
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:16,880
Let's just sleep for now.

75
00:03:22,280 --> 00:03:23,040
Feelings.

76
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,560
What kind of connection is this?

77
00:03:30,440 --> 00:03:33,080
Being together requires emotions, don't you know?

78
00:03:33,360 --> 00:03:34,360
You blockhead.

79
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,000
Why does this wine taste so bad?

80
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:50,640
Wait, no.

81
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:51,920
Qi Miao.

82
00:03:52,640 --> 00:03:54,120
Why do you keep thinking about him?

83
00:03:54,760 --> 00:03:56,560
Could it be that you actually like him?

84
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,240
Liking someone means

85
00:04:06,400 --> 00:04:10,120
wanting to share every little thing with them.

86
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:18,240
Qi Miao.

87
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,520
Come here for a moment.

88
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:28,680
Teacher Jiang.

89
00:04:31,040 --> 00:04:31,720
Qi Miao.

90
00:04:32,040 --> 00:04:33,800
Director Chen Feng's 'Autumn Moon' film crew

91
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,880
is currently short of a temporary on-site screenwriter.

92
00:04:36,160 --> 00:04:37,120
I recommended you for the job.

93
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,200
If you have nothing else to do, go pack up a bit.

94
00:04:39,280 --> 00:04:40,720
You can join the crew in the next couple of days.

95
00:04:41,240 --> 00:04:42,440
Director Chen Feng's crew, right?

96
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:43,800
Thank you, Teacher Jiang.

97
00:04:44,040 --> 00:04:45,040
Well, if there's nothing else,

98
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:45,760
I'll head out now.

99
00:04:45,880 --> 00:04:46,360
Go ahead.

100
00:05:01,600 --> 00:05:03,480
When you like someone,

101
00:05:03,600 --> 00:05:07,360
you just want to share everything with them.

102
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:09,560
What am I doing?

103
00:05:09,680 --> 00:05:11,680
Why did I want to tell him first?

104
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,000
What are you thinking, Qi Xiaomiao?

105
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:23,200
Jian Dan.

106
00:05:24,440 --> 00:05:25,320
I...

107
00:05:26,120 --> 00:05:27,920
I think I might like someone.

108
00:05:32,520 --> 00:05:34,320
This lady here, the 'iron tree,' has finally bloomed after all these years.

109
00:05:34,400 --> 00:05:35,680
Why are you not surprised at all?

110
00:05:36,680 --> 00:05:37,640
That's nothing new.

111
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:39,560
Isn't it that guy you're sharing a place with?

112
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,280
How... how did you know?

113
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:43,280
Girl,

114
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,960
you liking him is practically written all over your face!

115
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,800
Is it... is it that obvious?

116
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:53,080
But I don't know if he likes me.

117
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:55,600
And I have no idea what's going on in his mind.

118
00:05:56,280 --> 00:05:58,560
Besides, there's also one key issue.

119
00:05:58,840 --> 00:05:59,840
What issue?

120
00:06:01,760 --> 00:06:02,880
He's not from here.

121
00:06:03,920 --> 00:06:05,600
Being from out-of-town isn't that strange, right?

122
00:06:06,280 --> 00:06:07,720
Way farther than that.

123
00:06:07,800 --> 00:06:09,640
Like, a really, really far place.

124
00:06:10,280 --> 00:06:11,120
How far exactly?

125
00:06:11,240 --> 00:06:12,280
An alien, maybe?

126
00:06:16,360 --> 00:06:18,840
You're just making excuses for holding back.

127
00:06:19,280 --> 00:06:20,000
Let me ask you,

128
00:06:20,200 --> 00:06:21,360
do you really like him?

129
00:06:23,480 --> 00:06:25,200
Then if you like him, go for it, girl!

130
00:06:25,280 --> 00:06:26,160
Confess to him!

131
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,520
Girls don't confess first.

132
00:06:28,600 --> 00:06:29,360
What's wrong with that?

133
00:06:29,800 --> 00:06:32,080
If I, Jian Dan, liked a guy,

134
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:33,880
I wouldn't hesitate.

135
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:35,440
I'd just pin him against the wall and say,

136
00:06:37,080 --> 00:06:37,920
Hey, handsome,

137
00:06:38,200 --> 00:06:39,640
want to date me?

138
00:06:40,440 --> 00:06:41,160
Jian Dan!

139
00:06:41,480 --> 00:06:43,360
I'll think it over again myself.

140
00:06:44,440 --> 00:06:45,600
Don't chicken out, girl!

141
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:46,400
Go for it!

142
00:06:51,320 --> 00:06:52,080
Hao Ruichi.

143
00:06:53,160 --> 00:06:53,920
Hao Ruichi.

144
00:06:58,320 --> 00:06:59,160
He's not here.

145
00:07:19,320 --> 00:07:20,200
What are you looking at?

146
00:07:23,240 --> 00:07:23,960
Hao Ruichi.

147
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:25,240
Let me ask you.

148
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,760
How do you feel about me?

149
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:30,360
I feel really strange right now.

150
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:32,240
I don't even know how to express it.

151
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,320
Hao Ruichi.

152
00:07:34,200 --> 00:07:34,960
You kept saying.

153
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:36,600
That you wanted to be with me forever.

154
00:07:36,760 --> 00:07:38,440
Do you actually like me?

155
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:39,280
Or is this just.

156
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:41,280
Part of your plan to replenish energy?

157
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:42,360
It's not like that.

158
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:43,680
We've already formed a connection.

159
00:07:43,800 --> 00:07:45,080
The plan no longer exists.

160
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:47,240
Alright.

161
00:07:47,960 --> 00:07:48,840
Then let me ask you.

162
00:07:49,720 --> 00:07:50,720
The way you treat me like this.

163
00:07:51,120 --> 00:07:52,240
Is it because you like me?

164
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:53,480
Or because of the connection?

165
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:57,480
Feelings don't mean much.

166
00:07:58,600 --> 00:07:59,400
In front of the connection.

167
00:08:33,640 --> 00:08:35,240
Hao Ruichi already knows where I am.

168
00:08:35,880 --> 00:08:37,360
I need to leave here as soon as possible.

169
00:08:38,440 --> 00:08:39,719
But if I leave,

170
00:08:41,240 --> 00:08:42,400
What about Jianjian?

171
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:46,400
What's wrong?

172
00:08:47,079 --> 00:08:48,000
Jianjian, I...

173
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,720
What's going on with you?

174
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:53,960
You've been so absent-minded these past two days.

175
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:56,840
Is there something on your mind?

176
00:08:57,480 --> 00:08:58,600
There's something I want to tell you.

177
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,640
But I don't know how to explain it.

178
00:09:01,800 --> 00:09:02,560
Aiyet.

179
00:09:03,240 --> 00:09:04,440
Are you planning to leave?
